{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Terraspace! Here you have to go on an exciting journey through the galaxy and build a spaceship that will help you move to another planet. But this is not just a construction game \u2014 it's a whole universe where you can show your skills as a strategist and engineer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535330/extras/6e1800eea562f93a4d330fd5177205f4.poster.avif?t=1762068645\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535330/extras/6e1800eea562f93a4d330fd5177205f4.webm?t=1762068645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535330/extras/6e1800eea562f93a4d330fd5177205f4.mp4?t=1762068645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game &quot;Terraspace&quot; you will be engaged in the construction of equipment that will allow you to extract the necessary resources: food, water, electricity and other consumables. You will have to plan your actions carefully to provide your team with everything necessary for survival in space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But your main goal is not to destroy the astronauts and build a spaceship that can transport you to another planet. To do this, you will need to create new designs and collect resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535330/extras/df340da685f6e0a456252ccf18158c7d.avif?t=1762068645\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535330/extras_big/df340da685f6e0a456252ccf18158c7d.avif?t=1762068645 width=800 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features of the game &quot;Terraspace&quot;:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* A variety of technologies and designs to create.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Addictive and addictive gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Beautiful graphics and atmospheric soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for the most exciting journey of your life? Then welcome to the game &quot;Terraspace&quot;, where every step you take will matter, and every decision will affect the outcome of the entire mission!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3535330?t=1762068645","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535330/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762068645","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535330/be67b457c6aeb708cd0efc6a8124df3a76a2074c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762068645","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535330/be67b457c6aeb708cd0efc6a8124df3a76a2074c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762068645","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Terraspace! Here you have to go on an exciting journey through the galaxy and build a spaceship that will help you move to another planet. But this is not just a construction game \u2014 it's a whole universe where you can show your skills as a strategist and engineer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535330/extras/6e1800eea562f93a4d330fd5177205f4.poster.avif?t=1762068645\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535330/extras/6e1800eea562f93a4d330fd5177205f4.webm?t=1762068645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535330/extras/6e1800eea562f93a4d330fd5177205f4.mp4?t=1762068645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game &quot;Terraspace&quot; you will be engaged in the construction of equipment that will allow you to extract the necessary resources: food, water, electricity and other consumables. You will have to plan your actions carefully to provide your team with everything necessary for survival in space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But your main goal is not to destroy the astronauts and build a spaceship that can transport you to another planet. To do this, you will need to create new designs and collect resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535330/extras/df340da685f6e0a456252ccf18158c7d.avif?t=1762068645\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535330/extras_big/df340da685f6e0a456252ccf18158c7d.avif?t=1762068645 width=800 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features of the game &quot;Terraspace&quot;:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* A variety of technologies and designs to create.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Addictive and addictive gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Beautiful graphics and atmospheric soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for the most exciting journey of your life? Then welcome to the game &quot;Terraspace&quot;, where every step you take will matter, and every decision will affect the outcome of the entire mission!</p>","developers":["Black Apple"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535330/5fc62a33f3e